<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 106,000 -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 106,000 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Opening trade not well established. Early sales barrows and gilts steady to $.50 lower than the mid-session Monday.</p>
<p>Monday's actual receipts 106,000 versus 105,000 estimated.</p>
